<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-G.E. Crane appoints new director.</title>
<headline>RTRS-G.E. Crane appoints new director.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Building products group G.E. Crane Holdings Ltd said on Monday it has appointed John B. Fairfax as a director of the company.</p>
<p>Fairfax, 54, is chairman of Rural Press Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
